        "description": "A unit with this rule gains the Daemon Keyword. The Daemon unit has a 5+ Invulnerable save and the Fear (1) special rule. Daemon units have +1” to their Movement (M) characteristic. (This is included in unit data sheets that have the Daemon special rule by default)",
